<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Alternative cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Alternative cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown &amp; Sons Inc said it cut its rating of Alternative Resources Corp to a neutral from a buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Perry Boyle was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- shares slipped 1/4 to 22-3/4 in early trading.</p>
